WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.586 --> 00:00:04.352
MISS MINUTES
Welcome to the Time Variance Authority.

00:00:04.352 --> 00:00:05.024
[Loki grunts]

00:00:05.048 --> 00:00:07.055
MISS MINUTES
I'm Miss Minutes, and it's my job

00:00:07.055 --> 00:00:10.625
to catch you up before
you stand trial for your crimes!

00:00:10.625 --> 00:00:12.084
So, settle in...

00:00:12.109 --> 00:00:13.751
LOKI
Now, hang on just a minute!

00:00:15.602 --> 00:00:17.259
MISS MINUTES
...and we'll get you in front of a judge

00:00:17.259 --> 00:00:18.610
 in no time.

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:21.399
LOKI
[Laughs] Who actually believes this crap?

00:00:21.399 --> 00:00:22.555
TVA AGENT
Sir, let me see your ticket.

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:23.680
MAN
No.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:25.824
[Man screams]

00:00:25.824 --> 00:00:28.029
MISS MINUTES
Thanks for visiting the TVA.

00:00:28.029 --> 00:00:30.014
Don't hesitate to
let us know how we're doing!

00:00:32.006 --> 00:00:33.408
LOKI
What do you want from me?

00:00:34.795 --> 00:00:37.788
MOBIUS
You put our timeline in chaos.

00:00:38.998 --> 00:00:40.886
I want you to help us fix it.

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:42.443
LOKI
What could possibly go wrong?

00:00:43.185 --> 00:00:45.362
JUDGE RENSLAYER
Trusting Loki is not a good idea.

00:00:48.068 --> 00:00:49.115
LOKI
Do I get a weapon?

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:50.662
MOBIUS
Gear up.

00:00:50.662 --> 00:00:52.266
TVA AGENT
Absolutely not.

